{"_id":"pT4z3YR0napMePh3","folder":null,"img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/myth-speaker-bestiary/pyrkaion.webp","items":[{"_id":"HAGdFm4UVQ0WIX65","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Claw","sort":100000,"system":{"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"bonus":{"value":18},"damageRolls":{"kZ0UQnlS3CKNXTRC":{"damage":"2d8+8","damageType":"slashing"}},"description":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"range":null,"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pT4z3YR0napMePh3.HAGdFm4UVQ0WIX65"},{"_id":"Yt2bXPAOzqlfJ3is","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Tusk","sort":200000,"system":{"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"bonus":{"value":18},"damageRolls":{"vVuO6odzuxJDginM":{"damage":"2d10+8","damageType":"piercing"}},"description":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"range":null,"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pT4z3YR0napMePh3.Yt2bXPAOzqlfJ3is"},{"_id":"3UzDAIuewhIHVY6b","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Riddle","sort":300000,"system":{"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"bonus":{"value":20},"damageRolls":{"5qcfeRzSSnOJoceO":{"category":"persistent","damage":"1d6","damageType":"mental"},"xRiByxni2EZjAwpv":{"damage":"3d8","damageType":"mental"}},"description":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"range":{"increment":null,"max":60},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pT4z3YR0napMePh3.3UzDAIuewhIHVY6b"},{"_id":"oiUWPW3H3dRfVLAy","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Aura of Sophistry","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>40 feet. The pyrkaion hones others' thoughts, enabling extraordinary reasoning or ruinous revelation. If the pyrkaion has the holy trait (see Glorious Visage below), all allied creatures within the aura gain a +1 status bonus to check to Recall Knowledge and resistance 4 to mental damage. If the pyrkaion has the unholy trait, all unallied creatures in the area take a –1 penalty to checks to Recall Knowledge and gain the effects of the Dubious Knowledge feat when Recalling Knowledge; whenever an affected creature Recalls Knowledge, they become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} and gain weakness 4 to mental damage for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"effects":[{"affects":"allies","includesSelf":false,"predicate":["self:trait:holy"],"uuid":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.dgZYRgGzwdWyZFOh"},{"affects":"enemies","predicate":["self:trait:unholy"],"uuid":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.JksGGYzQqsNqeTQj"}],"key":"Aura","radius":40,"traits":["divine","mental"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["aura","divine","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pT4z3YR0napMePh3.oiUWPW3H3dRfVLAy"},{"_id":"nZEjb0DJkGrnlJ13","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Witty Reversal","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 30 feet uses a linguistic or mental effect</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The pyrkaion attempts to counteract the effect (counteract rank 4, counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+16 #Counteract]]{+16}). If successful, the pyrkaion can choose to corrupt the effect, dealing @Damage[2d6[persistent,mental]] damage to the triggering effect's targets unless those targets succeed at a @Check[will|dc:26] save.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["linguistic"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pT4z3YR0napMePh3.nZEjb0DJkGrnlJ13"},{"_id":"5YdMb0i7X2Rw3eZ9","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Glorious Visage","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The asura sanctifies themselves as either holy or unholy, gaining the trait corresponding to their choice and losing the opposing trait; their strikes, spells, and abilities also gain the trait corresponding to their choice. The asura also gains weakness 8 to the opposing sanctification and loses any weakness to its chosen sanctification. The choice is permanent until the asura uses this ability to change their sanctification.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"alwaysActive":true,"key":"RollOption","option":"glorious-visage","selection":"unholy","suboptions":[{"label":"PF2E.TraitHoly","value":"holy"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitUnholy","value":"unholy"}],"toggleable":true,"value":true},{"add":["{item|flags.system.rulesSelections.gloriousVisage}"],"key":"ActorTraits"},{"itemType":"melee","key":"ItemAlteration","mode":"add","property":"traits","value":"{item|flags.system.rulesSelections.gloriousVisage}"},{"key":"Weakness","predicate":["glorious-visage:unholy"],"type":"holy","value":8},{"key":"Weakness","predicate":["glorious-visage:holy"],"type":"unholy","value":8}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pT4z3YR0napMePh3.5YdMb0i7X2Rw3eZ9"},{"_id":"Q6fEOr6gGayZ34K5","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Insidious Query","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The pyrkaion questions a creature within 40 feet, who must attempt a @Check[will|dc:26] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature becomes immune for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> If the creature doesn't Recall Knowledge by the end of its next turn, it becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but until the end of their next turn, the creature also takes @Damage[2d6[mental]] damage when Recalling Knowledge.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["auditory","linguistic"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pT4z3YR0napMePh3.Q6fEOr6gGayZ34K5"},{"_id":"U73i2YjcL0nSVmKr","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/lore.svg","name":"Academia Lore","sort":800000,"system":{"description":{"value":""},"mod":{"value":18},"proficient":{"value":0},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"lore","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!pT4z3YR0napMePh3.U73i2YjcL0nSVmKr"}],"name":"Pyrkaion","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":3},"dex":{"mod":3},"int":{"mod":4},"str":{"mod":4},"wis":{"mod":6}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":27},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"","max":132,"temp":0,"value":132},"immunities":[{"exceptions":[],"type":"curse"}],"resistances":[{"doubleVs":[],"exceptions":[],"type":"mental","value":8}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[],"value":25},"weaknesses":[]},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"Telepathy 60 feet","value":["common","diabolic"]},"level":{"value":8},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>Reality is imperfect, yet many mortals focus on their world's virtues while refusing to address its failures. A pyrkaion believes mortal delusion is the last wall propping up a broken universe, and wisdom is the pickaxe that will tear it down. Pyrkaions vacillate between teaching mortals enough to wither from indulgent self-awareness and shredding their students' institutions through insidious interrogation that leads to infighting as the asura watches.</p><h2>Philosophical Zeal</h2><p>With each philosophical victory, these asuras increasingly wrestle with their own thoughts, recognizing that they're as vulnerable to self-delusion as their victims. This can drive a pyrkaion to ravenous fits of reading and research before jealously sequestering the texts. Sometimes a pyrkaion with an inflated ego instead seeks and loses debates, craving the sting of humility to recenter their thoughts.</p>","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder #217: Death Sails a Wine-Dark Sea"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":18,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":15},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":13},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":18}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":16},"diplomacy":{"base":16},"intimidation":{"base":16},"occultism":{"base":16},"religion":{"base":18}},"traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"},"value":["asura","spirit"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.myth-speaker-bestiary.Actor.KTG7qtxnTG81QQ2W"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!pT4z3YR0napMePh3","prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/myth-speaker-bestiary/pyrkaion.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"myth_speaker_bestiary__pyrkaion","sourcePack":"pf2e.myth-speaker-bestiary","sourceDocId":"KTG7qtxnTG81QQ2W"}}}